411. Chart No. 1
Chart No. 1 is not actually a chart but a book containing a key to chart symbols. Most countries which produce charts also produce such a list. The U.S. Chart No. 1 contains a listing of chart symbols in four categories:
• Chart symbols used by the National Ocean Service • Chart symbols used by NIMA • Chart symbols recommended by the International Hydrographic Organization • Chart symbols used on foreign charts reproduced by NIMA
